message: "If you use these weights, please cite this release and the source dataset."
title: "GainNet: sentence-level neural gain from fMRI"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-01-01
license: CC-BY-4.0
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "[to be completed]"
    given-names: "[to be completed]"
repository-code: "https://github.com/<org>/gainnet"
url: "https://huggingface.co/<org>/gainnet"
keywords:
  - fMRI
  - naturalistic neuroimaging
  - sentence embeddings
  - multimodal retrieval
  - salience
abstract: >
  2,700 per-region, per-participant networks mapping a sentence embedding to a
  scalar neural gain, trained on fMRI responses to 2-second video clips described
  by single sentences. Includes the participant-averaged gain table for 66,270
  sentences and 90 AAL regions.
